# Build context is the repository root (see apps/*/Dockerfile).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/coverage-e2e
**/.vite

# VCS, CI and tooling that images never need
.git
.github
.husky
docs

# Secrets and local environment files
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.production.example

# Editor / agent folders
**/.claude
**/.agents
**/.windsurf
**/skills-lock.json
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store

# Docs and logs
**/*.md
**/*.log

# Compose files are not part of any image
compose*.yaml
